    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_ebb493ff",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: welcome_to_the_future; hasOverallIntent: non-toxic-positive; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a vibrant, joyful drag performer at what appears to be a Pride parade or LGBTQ+ event, with the text 'welcome to the future' overlaid. The scene is celebratory, featuring rainbow colors, a rainbow flag, and a festive atmosphere. The performer's exaggerated expression and colorful costume are meant to convey exuberance and inclusivity. There is no toxicity present; the meme does not target any protected group with hate, abuse, or harmful stereotypes. The intent is to celebrate diversity, progress, and the LGBTQ+ community, using the visual of a flamboyant, joyful figure to symbolize a hopeful, accepting future. The juxtaposition of the text with the image reinforces a message of optimism and social progress.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_01459e24"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
