      "instance_name": "drag_performer",
      "label": "central figure",
      "description": "A person in a vibrant drag costume with a large pink wig, wearing a yellow and green sheer top and rainbow-colored pants, holding a blue bucket. Their expression is exaggeratedly joyful with an open mouth, suggesting excitement or performance. This individual is the focal point of the image and the primary subject of the meme's message.",
