      "instance_name": "celebratory_parade",
      "label": "celebratory_parade",
      "description": "A vibrant, joyful drag performer is the central focus of a Pride parade or LGBTQ+ event, surrounded by a crowd of attendees. The performer's exaggerated expression and colorful costume convey exuberance and inclusivity, while the background features a decorated truck and rainbow flags, reinforcing a festive, hopeful atmosphere. The text 'welcome to the future' overlays the image, symbolizing optimism and social progress.",
