      "instance_name": "LGBTQ_Pride_Parade",
      "label": "LGBTQ+ Pride Parade",
      "description": "The image depicts a celebratory event that is widely recognized as a Pride parade, which is an annual public demonstration held in support of LGBTQ+ rights and visibility. The presence of rainbow flags, diverse attendees, and a drag performer in a festive costume are all culturally coded indicators of such an event. Understanding that this is a Pride parade is essential to interpreting the meme’s message of inclusivity and social progress.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_01459e24"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_7221026f",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Drag_Performance",
      "label": "Drag Performance",
      "description": "The central figure is a drag performer, a cultural phenomenon rooted in LGBTQ+ communities, particularly in queer nightlife and performance art. Drag performance involves exaggerated costumes, makeup, and personas, often used to challenge gender norms and celebrate self-expression. Recognizing this context is necessary to understand the performer’s joyful expression and the meme’s celebration of identity and liberation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_01459e24"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
