      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Rainbow_Flag",
      "label": "Rainbow Flag",
      "description": "The rainbow flag is the internationally recognized symbol of LGBTQ+ pride and solidarity. Its presence in the image (visible on the truck and worn by attendees) is a direct visual cue that the event is LGBTQ+-focused. Without knowledge of this symbol’s meaning, the image’s message of inclusivity and progress would be ambiguous.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
